Summarize finalized topology, routes, load balancers and unresolved references

Usage: aws-inventory architecture [OPTIONS] --scan-id <SCAN_ID>

Options:
      --db <DB>            [default: inventory.sqlite]
      --scan-id <SCAN_ID>  
      --limit <LIMIT>      Maximum rows per panel; truncation is reported explicitly [default: 100]
  -h, --help               Print help
